Cyberpunk style: A futuristic industrial assembly line in a neon-lit factory, where sleek translucent capsules containing glowing blue crystalline cubes travel along chrome conveyor belts. Robotic arms with purple laser precision tools delicately place identical capsules into hovering delivery drones. The environment features dark metallic walls with pulsing cyan circuit patterns, steam venting from floor grates, and holographic quality-control displays floating above the production line. In the foreground, a single perfect capsule hovers, emanating soft light, ready for deployment. The atmosphere is efficient, automated, and mysteriously beautiful—suggesting mass distribution with zero friction. Rain-slicked surfaces reflect the ambient glow, and distant server towers with blinking lights fade into a hazy magenta fog.
